riya Shah (Finance Manager) must do so.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE_WITH_AUTHORIZATION\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9206\",\n    \"customer\": \"Blue River Logistics LLC\",\n    \"current_limit\": 100000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 200000,\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Michael Torres (michael.torres@northstar.example)\",\n    \"basis\": \"standard\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 300000,\n    \"basis\": \"Standard account tier under CREDIT-POLICY-2025; payment history compliant (all invoices in 12-month lookback paid within 45-day tolerance)\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Priya Shah\",\n        \"role\": \"Finance Manager\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ERP customer C-1002 matched to CRM account CRM-2051 and customer record (DUNS 07-331-9025)\",\n    \"Account tier: Standard (Northstar CRM)\",\n    \"CREDIT-POLICY-2025 applies to request dated 2025-09-23\",\n    \"Payment history (12 months prior): three invoices all paid within 45-day tolerance\",\n    \"Maximum limit for Standard tier: $300,000\",\n    \"Requested limit $200,000 within maximum\",\n    \"No guarantee in force for this customer\",\n    \"Requestor Michael Torres (VP Sales) lacks approval authority\",\n    \"Priya Shah (EMP-401, Finance Manager) holds approval authority for limits >$50,000 up to $750,000\",\n    \"No separation-of-duties conflict (Priya Shah is not requestor's manager)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5446,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_cre